International Components for Unicode (ICU) 68 built as 64-bit Windows
DLLs (icuuc68.dll, icuin68.dll, icudt68.dll) for proton-wine.

Wine's icu.dll forwards to these libraries.  Programs built on .NET 5
or later use icu.dll for culture-aware text handling and fail to start
without it.  proton-openbsd copies them into each wine prefix, as
Valve's Proton does.
